<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippines approves Belle capital hike.</title>
<headline>Philippines approves Belle capital hike.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippines' Securities and Exchange Commission had approved the capital increase of Belle Corp to 20 billion pesos from its present four billion pesos, the company said on Monday.</p>
<p>Corporate secretary Bayani Tan told the Philippine Stock Exchange the increase will be done through the issue of non-voting, non-convertible preferred shares of which 5.0 billion pesos worth will be sold through a private placement.</p>
<p>Belle Corp has interests in property and gaming.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
